// boss_intro.script — a minimal set-piece for the scripted verb dispatcher.
// One verb per line: <verb> [args].  // starts a comment.  Blank lines ignored.
//
// The sequence: the scripted monster walks to a marker, waits a beat, then
// holds until a player comes into its sight, and only then attacks. The blocking
// verbs (wait / hold / playersight) suspend the cursor and resume on their
// wake-condition — the whole point of the re-entrant runner.
print boss-intro-begin
gotomarker script_marker_a   // set a nav goal toward the named marker
hold                          // suspend until the walk finishes (nav arrival)
wait 500                      // suspend a fixed half-second, then continue
faceangles 180 0             // choreography: face back the way it came
playersight                   // suspend until a player is in sight (then target them)
print player-spotted
attack                        // engage the player it just spotted
